<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Co Inc cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Co Inc cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Sun Co Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 24-3/8 Monday.  </p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for details.</p>
</text>
